                    stale-routes-time 3600
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<ip-address>` with the peer's IP address. This sets the local stale route timer to 3600 seconds (1 hour) at the neighbor level, overriding any peer-advertised values.
