To pass VPNv4 routes over an IPv6-based BGP session while preserving the peer's IPv6 next-hop, use these commands:

```cli
configure router bgp group <group_name> neighbor <peer_ipv6_address> family vpn-ipv4
configure router bgp group <group_name> neighbor <peer_ipv6_address> advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4
configure router bgp group <group_name> neighbor <peer_ipv6_address> next-hop-unchanged
```

