- `family vpn-ipv4` enables VPNv4 route exchange.  
- `advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv4` forces VPNv4 routes to use IPv6 next-hops over IPv6 transport.  
- `next-hop-unchanged` prevents modification of the next-hop address during advertisement.  

Replace `<group_name>` and `<peer_ipv6_address>` with your BGP group and neighbor IPv6 address. Ensure both peers support extended next-hop encoding (RFC 8950).
