To configure your Nokia 7750 SR for multicast VPNv4 route optimization, use the following commands:

```console
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `send 8` limits parallel route advertisements to **8 paths** per multicast VPNv4 group.  
- `receive` enables processing of **multiple incoming routes** per VPNv4 group.  

Apply this configuration in the global BGP context (`config>router>bgp>add-paths`) to affect all peers. For group-specific or neighbor-specific adjustments, use the same command under `config>router>bgp>group>add-paths` or `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>add-paths`. This ensures balanced multicast traffic distribution across redundant links.
