```cli
configure router bgp 
    group "<group-name>" 
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            graceful-restart
                enable-notification
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

### Key details:
- `graceful-restart` activates the helper mode to preserve routes during peer reboots
- `enable-notification` extends support for session restarts triggered by NOTIFICATION messages
- The configuration is applied at the neighbor level for precise control

