3. Stations configured under BGP `monitor` without corresponding `bmp>station` configuration will not process messages (silent failure).
4. Use `show router bgp bmp` to verify station connection state and monitored peers. Common issues include:
   - TCP port blocking (default port 5000)
   - Mismatched routing instances between BGP peers and BMP station
   - Policy blocks (ensure `bmp-connection` policies permit the session)
