                from ext-community "COMM_65001_12345"
                action accept
            exit
            entry 20
                action reject
            exit
   ```

4. **Apply Policies to BGP:**
   - **For inbound filtering (accept only tagged routes):**
     ```cli
     /configure router bgp
          group "your_group_name"  # Replace with your BGP group name
             import "IMPORT_FILTER"
