To ensure BGP prioritizes specific traffic-engineered paths (SR-TE tunnels) for next-hop resolution, configure the resolution filter to exclusively use SR-TE tunnels. This forces BGP to align next-hop decisions with active TE policies:

```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution
    shortcut-tunn
        family ipv4
            resolution-filter sr-te
        exit
        family ipv6
            resolution-filter sr-te
        exit
    exit
    labeled-routes
        transport-tunnel
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-te
            exit
