                resolution-filter sr-te
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key adjustments:**
- `resolution-filter sr-te` is applied to both IPv4 and IPv6 address families under `shortcut-tunn` (unlabeled routes) and `labeled-routes` (labeled routes).
